WEBVTT

00:03:28.485 --> 00:03:31.555
at 150 miles an hour through the Bonneville Salt Flats,

00:03:31.555 --> 00:03:36.026
gone around Thunderhill Raceway Park in the sun,

00:03:36.026 --> 00:03:38.665
the wind and the rain,

00:03:38.665 --> 00:03:43.683
and navigated the 153 turns and 12.4 miles

00:03:43.683 --> 00:03:45.245
of the Pikes Peak Hill Climb route

00:03:45.245 --> 00:03:48.718
in Colorado with nobody at the wheel.

00:03:48.718 --> 00:03:50.166
(Laughter)

00:03:50.166 --> 00:03:55.732
(Applause)

00:03:55.732 --> 00:03:59.011
I guess it goes without saying that we've had a lot of fun

00:03:59.011 --> 00:04:00.315
doing this.